1
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:19,980
I put one habit down, watched the dust settle slow,

2
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:24,180
Thought the storm had passed me, thought I was good to go.

3
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:28,180
Then a different hunger started knocking at my door,

4
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:32,240
Same old ache in new clothes, like I'd met this ghost before.

5
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,400
Different label, same flame,

6
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,580
Different road, same rain.

7
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,900
I am not broken, I am learning

8
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,180
How the pattern calls my name.

9
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:46,180
Same loop, new name,
Trigger to craving, back again.

10
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:50,200
Short relief, then the weight comes through,

11
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:55,760
I am not failing, I am seeing what is true.

12
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:03,240
Same loop, new name,
But I can slow it, I can change.

13
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:08,760
One clear pause, one honest breath,
And I choose a different step.

14
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:19,760
Stress at midnight, loneliness at two,

15
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:24,480
Boredom in the morning finds a shortcut to undo.

16
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:27,660
Could be food, could be scrolling, could be spending for a spark,

17
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:31,900
Could be work, could be nicotine, anything to dodge the dark.

18
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:39,280
My mind learned survival
From whatever eased the pain.

19
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:47,000
Now I teach it something gentler,
Not perfection - just a way.

20
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:54,500
Same loop, new name,
Trigger to craving, back again.

21
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:58,800
Short relief, then the weight comes through,

22
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:05,000
I am not failing, I am seeing what is true.

23
00:02:06,660 --> 00:02:11,180
Same loop, new name,
But I can slow it, I can change.

24
00:02:11,180 --> 00:02:16,000
One clear pause, one honest breath,
And I choose a different step.

25
00:02:24,010 --> 00:02:30,070
Map the hour, map the feeling, map the places I get pulled,

26
00:02:30,070 --> 00:02:32,570
Build a rhythm, build a refuge, make the empty moments full.

27
00:02:32,570 --> 00:02:36,770
If withdrawal risk is rising, I reach for medical hands,

28
00:02:36,770 --> 00:02:40,730
And for the deeper pattern work, I heal where it began.

29
00:02:40,730 --> 00:02:45,090
Hypnotherapy for the pause, EFT to calm the wave,

30
00:02:45,090 --> 00:02:51,090
Small repeats become a pathway, and that pathway starts to change.

31
00:02:53,290 --> 00:02:56,800
Same loop, new name,

32
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:59,900
I know the pattern, I know the game.

33
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:02,130
Trigger to craving doesn't own me now,

34
00:03:02,130 --> 00:03:10,890
I meet it with awareness anyhow.

35
00:03:10,890 --> 00:03:13,500
Same loop, new name,

36
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:15,970
Steady progress over shame.

37
00:03:15,970 --> 00:03:20,890
Same brain, new patterns, day by day,
I am finding my way.

38
00:03:26,690 --> 00:03:28,900
Not a perfect line, just honest ground,

39
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:31,170
Less escape, more life, more now.

40
00:03:31,170 --> 00:03:36,390
What once was automatic can be relearned in time,

41
00:03:36,390 --> 00:03:44,200
Same loop, new name - new ending, mine.
